questions.analysis:
$z=x f(x+y)$ 与 $F(x, y, z)=0$ 两边对 $x$ 求导得

$\left\{\begin{array} { l }
{ \dfrac { \mathrm { d } z } { \mathrm { d } x } = f + x ( 1 + \dfrac { \mathrm { d } y } { \mathrm { d } x } ) f ^ { \prime } } \\
{ F _ { x } ^ { \prime } + F _ { y } ^ { \prime } \dfrac { \mathrm { d } y } { \mathrm { d } x } + F _ { z } ^ { \prime } \dfrac { \mathrm { d } z } { \mathrm { d } x } = 0  }
\end{array}\right.\\
\Rightarrow \left\{\begin{array}{l}
-x f^{\prime} \dfrac{\mathrm{d} y}{\mathrm{d} x}+\dfrac{\mathrm{d} z}{\mathrm{d} x}=f+x f^{\prime}\\
F_y^{\prime} \dfrac{\mathrm{d} y}{\mathrm{d} x}+F_z^{\prime} \dfrac{\mathrm{d} z}{\mathrm{d} x}=-F_x^{\prime}
\end{array}\right.
$

解得 $\displaystyle \frac{\mathrm{d} z}{\mathrm{d} x}=\frac{\left(f+x f^{\prime}\right) F_y^{\prime}-x f^{\prime} F_x^{\prime}}{F_y^{\prime}+x f^{\prime} F_z^{\prime}} \quad\left(F_y^{\prime}+x f^{\prime} F_z^{\prime} \neq 0\right)$

